"""Train style classifier (formality + gender + grammaticality) on Japanese sentence corpus.

This script orchestrates the full training pipeline:
1. Environment detection (GPU, batch sizes, gradient accumulation)
2. Preprocessing/labeling phase (via scripts.label)
3. Training phase (via scripts.train_style)
4. Confusion matrix evaluation (via scripts.confusion)

Usage:
    ./train_style                    # Default training
    ./train_style --label            # Preprocessing only

Setup:
    source requirements.sh           # One-time setup (installs deps, activates venv)
"""

